{
  "_comment": "Canonical Claude Code permission allow-patterns the cq-design pipeline needs. Seeded into the working directory's .claude/settings.local.json by init_permissions.py. The run_cadquery_model.py Bash entry is the sentinel used to detect prior init. Both Bash and PowerShell variants are included; wildcards absorb the interpolated SKILL_DIR path and per-part arguments. Read/scaffold/build shapes only -- no destructive verbs.",
